@startuml 2c_sinif_komut_gecmisi
!include _stil.iuml
title Sınıf diyagramı (3/4): geri al / yinele — Command ve Composite desenleri
class "actions/edit.js" as ACT <<denetleyici (istemci)>> {
  addComponent(), connectPorts()
  deleteSelection(), setParam()
  undo(), redo()
  pasteFragment()
}
class History <<çağıran (invoker)>> {
  - undo : Command[*]
  - redo : Command[*]
  - sealed : bool
  + limit : sayı
  + execute(cmd)
  + record(cmd)
  + undo() : Command
  + redo() : Command
  + seal()
  + canUndo, canRedo : bool
}
class Doc <<belge>> {
  + wf : Workflow
}
class engine <<alıcı (receiver)>> {
  addNode(), connect()
  removeEdge()
}
interface Command {
  + label : dizgi
  + key? : dizgi
  + do(doc)
  + undo(doc)
  + merge?(next) : Command
}
class MacroCommand <<Composite>> {
  - commands : Command[*]
  + do(doc) : sırayla
  + undo(doc) : ters sırayla
}
class AddNodeCommand
class RemoveNodeCommand {
  - saved : kutu, sıra, bağlantılar
}
class ConnectCommand
class MoveNodeCommand {
  key = "tasi:<id>"
  + merge(next)
}
class SetParamCommand {
  key = "ayar:<id>:<k>"
  + merge(next)
}
class ReplaceWorkflowCmd {
  - before, after
  + meta : açık paket
}
ACT --> History : execute(cmd)
History o-- "*" Command : yığınlar
History --> Doc : doc
Command <|.. AddNodeCommand
Command <|.. RemoveNodeCommand
Command <|.. ConnectCommand
Command <|.. MoveNodeCommand
Command <|.. SetParamCommand
Command <|.. ReplaceWorkflowCmd
Command <|.. MacroCommand
MacroCommand o-- "*" Command : commands
Command ..> engine : do / undo motorun işlevleriyle
note bottom of ReplaceWorkflowCmd
  Aynı anahtarlı ardışık komutlar tek adımda birleşir;
  seal() birleştirmeyi keser. Paket açma da bir komuttur.
  Özellik tabanlı test: 4 tohum × 400 rastgele işlem.
end note
@enduml
